Enhancement: Fail PHP Unit when core's error handler swallowed PHP errors

An app's test bootstrap that loads lib/base.php without defining PHPUNIT_RUN gets
core's production OC\Log\ErrorHandler. PHPUnit's own handler then backs off, and
every notice, warning and deprecation raised during the suite was written to
owncloud.log while the job stayed green. The workflow now fails when the PHPUnit
or integration steps added entries logged with app "PHP" to owncloud.log. Only
that handler writes such entries.

https://github.com/owncloud/core/issues/41904
